        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Welcome to A.venue Pub!


        This world was made as a lighting
        study & challenge to make the lighting better than in Unreal Engine.


        I
        later then added more areas, features and gimmicks, and made it so everyone
        could host events here for free.


        This is currently in beta! Please
        report any bugs, thank you. (discord.gg/TxYwUFKbUS)'
